  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow pierces your forearm, the arrowhead lodging in the ulna bone. It’s stuck in there good!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1). The arm is useless until the arrow has been Extracted. After that it’ll count as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p><p>Extraction can only be performed after the encounter, requiring <strong>Surgery (Challenging)</strong>.</p>"
    },
